      "Explains gtars installation for Python bindings, CLI tools, and Rust projects.",
      "Shows RegionSet loading, set operations, export, and NumPy array workflows.",
      "Documents overlap detection and IGD indexing through Python and CLI examples.",
      "Guides coverage track generation for WIG, BigWig, and strand-specific outputs.",
      "Covers genomic tokenization for machine learning and geniml preprocessing.",
      "Describes refget digests, FASTA loading, subsequence extraction, and fragment processing."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "The skill provides documentation guidance, not executable helper scripts.",
